Z||000002||80's BOY||05-17-2000||04:52 PM||||trust me when i say it is NOT a direct replacement. i tried a total dashboard swap with no luck. someone told me the plugs will interchange. well, they do. too bad the WIRES are in DIFFERENT PLACES!! all i got was the "check engine" light. a little homework on the wiring harnesses would do the trick. it's not totally impossible. it would be easier to find someone who has done it, though.||||reg||10
Z||000003||DaRkLoRD||05-17-2000||06:47 PM||||There was one guy on the Fiero mailing list, by the name of Rick Stewart, who's done this swap. I have photos of his car and the gauges look pretty cool.<P>I wouldn't mind putting the whole cavalier dashboard into the fiero, I figure if a Bonneville dash could be modified to fit.. a cavalier one shouldn't be impossible.||||reg||1
